  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed development, by way of its scale and situation, would unacceptably harm neighbour's living conditions through an overbearing effect and unacceptable sense of enclosure. It would therefore be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character) and CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture).",
    "Condition : 2 - It is considered that the proposal, due to its bulk in the context of the site and the surrounding area, would appear as a cramped and incongruous development which would harm the street scene and appearance of the area.  This would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character) and CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture)."
  ],
